# ---- devlog data (NEVER commit: this is your personal activity log) ----
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
api-token.txt

# Real local repo paths and any historical author emails belong here, not in
# appsettings.json - that file is public. ASP.NET Core layers this over the
# base config automatically; nothing needs updating in Program.cs to use it.
appsettings.local.json
appsettings.*.local.json

# ---- held back from the public repo ----
# The seeder generates synthetic capture for local development and is not
# referenced from anywhere outside this folder - Devlog.Host builds without it.
# Kept private on general principle rather than for any specific leak.
backend/src/Devlog.Host/Seed/

# Real captured sessions, hand-labelled for Job A/B eval accuracy (docs/LLM.md
# section 9). Window titles are genuinely sensitive - server names, colleague
# names, ticket contents - and these files are the real thing, not test
# fixtures. The format they follow is documented in docs/llm-evals/README.md,
# which IS committed, with entirely fabricated examples.
docs/llm-evals/*.json

